│                          │ opposite-qubit pairs (0,4), (1,5), (2,6), (3,7) before the initial RY layer. This         │
│                          │ introduces long-range correlations early in the circuit at minimal cost (only +1          │
│                          │ trainable parameter, +4 gates, +1 depth), which should help the subsequent RY/RZ/CRZ      │
