                         Patch Metadata - Gen 57/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ backward_cz_ladder                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ Add a fixed (parameter-free) backward CZ ladder (qubit 7→6→…→0) after the existing skip-2 │
│                          │ CNOT backbone and before the parametrized CRZ layer. This increases entangling            │
│                          │ connectivity and mixes phase information across all neighboring qubits in the reverse     │
│                          │ direction, without adding any new trainable parameters (parameter count stays at 5        │
│                          │ distinct params). Phase-type (CZ) entangling gates tend to be less sensitive to           │
│                          │ bit-flip-like noise than CNOT chains and often improve generalization by providing richer │
│                          │ entanglement structure while keeping the model parameter-efficient — directly addressing  │
│                          │ the dominant "worst group margin" and generalization-gap scoring terms without any        │
│                          │ parameter cost.                                                                           │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0315                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
